    "overview": "This scoped record describes the Flutter Android/iOS client in `apps/client_mobile`, extracted from `lib/ui.dart`, `lib/main.dart`, and `lib/workspace.dart`. The pinned visual direction is an icy blue architectural login, a navy shield with company wordmark, and a blue gradient sign-in action. Inside the account, light cards, a case timeline, labeled document statuses, and blue/grey conversation bubbles keep progress legible.\n\nThe north-star phrase summarizes the supplied reference; it is not a separately approved brand slogan. Root PRODUCT.md and DESIGN.md describe an older web scope and are not the visual authority for this app. This record captures implementation, not full design acceptance or device certification.",
